{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "a629c33e98b88ff94a8389c4abe89a54fce42d64bdc2ac0f2bab0f308b0de3a1", "ja": "確かな感情、確かな笑顔", "zh": "真切的感情，真切的笑容", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "04845bd6c3a7f97d1455a84c3d9e21e21cb9c55186f2b1ff6f59d41203349493", "ja": "撮影時の小道具の使用について尋ねる瑞希。\n自分の仏頂面では間が持たないからと語るが\nプロデューサーは、瑞希はもういろんな表情\nを見せてくれていると語る。それを聞いた\n瑞希はやはり小道具はなしで挑むと微笑む。", "zh": "瑞希询问拍摄时是否可以使用小道具。\n她说只靠自己一脸严肃的表情，场面会冷下来，\n但制作人告诉她，瑞希已经展现过各种各样的表情了。\n听到这话后，瑞希微笑着表示，果然还是不用小道具来挑战。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1000_null", "source_sha256": "7fbe54412515d15e8969d29095f559e1b0a50b497c46002732db465635422435", "ja": "撮影内容の打ち合わせ中……", "zh": "正在商议拍摄内容……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1001_401pro", "source_sha256": "22ebc7bd3744356b606dfd9e2705d0d623a75786845db16ba851810f81b8f01f", "ja": "……と、撮影スケジュールの大枠はこんなところだ。\n何かわからないこととか、質問あるかな？", "zh": "……拍摄日程的大致框架就是这样。\n有什么不明白或者想问的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "2ba670ffe3f64f1012714161379eeb92188d408478f50c2f1389c69954cd6b7d", "ja": "はい、あります。\n撮影では、小道具を使ってもいいですか？", "zh": "有，有的。\n拍摄时可以使用道具吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1003_401pro", "source_sha256": "fbb8963ee886021d54bc0d3638666941e80432d0af286a3facb8664afe155f3e", "ja": "小道具？　……花とか帽子とか、そういうのか？", "zh": "道具？……像是花或者帽子之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "25beda570f1d2d95ebcd04c233f009183052b66bb73025bbdd313a1667b6fb4e", "ja": "そういうのです。あわよくば、コインやトランプ、\nステッキにシルクハットなども。", "zh": "就是那些。要是可以的话，还想要硬币、扑克牌、手杖和大礼帽之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1005_401pro", "source_sha256": "07fbd626cbee816c8818d1010d009f5390f04e35c0ddb907be4385dfc34f003d", "ja": "いや、そんなにはちょっと……。\nどうしたんだ、急に？", "zh": "不，要那么多可就有点……\n你怎么突然提这个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "9e5b2ea7dad41c878c203168c445c303de032ef453236d562b11b4c9f564bbc5", "ja": "先ほど、このCMの放送中は、私達の写真が\nペットボトルのラベルになると聞きました。", "zh": "刚才听说，在这则广告播出期间，我们的照片会成为塑料瓶的标签。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1007_401pro", "source_sha256": "5c909a89a91c005f64bdcd9af63a711046ac577444aaea549b654dd444018a3c", "ja": "ああ、期間限定でな！　ラベル用の写真は、\n撮影の合間に撮ってもらう予定だけど……。", "zh": "啊，是限时的！标签用的照片，打算在拍摄间隙请人帮我们拍……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1008_401pro", "source_sha256": "decd253b5b2210d060043474d792b9a2a363f0aec05f57e26d341e63b5ba3043", "ja": "え？　もしかして、\nラベル用の写真で小道具を持ちたいのか？", "zh": "诶？难道你是想在拍标签用的照片时拿着道具吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "22b725c4fc43726310eea89824bf6e9d0927804f0844156f98406751900909ad", "ja": "はい。高坂さん、百瀬さん、福田さん、篠宮さんは\nいろいろ華やかなので大丈夫ですが……。", "zh": "是的。高坂小姐、百濑小姐、福田小姐、筱宫小姐都很华丽，所以没问题，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "134c36ce150512661284aa5ac9220a191cfc2abd251446a3b4b1a98596bb68ea", "ja": "いろいろ控えめな私は、何か盛るものを持ったほうが\n良いと思います。……いろいろ控えめなので。", "zh": "各方面都很低调的我，觉得还是拿点能撑场面的东西\n会比较好。……因为各方面都很低调。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1011_401pro", "source_sha256": "5345c7fb45b588929795aa90d0bede759fbadc6b02de996f84cbb00a77fa302f", "ja": "そ、そうか……。\nでも、なんかマジックショーみたいだな……。", "zh": "是、是这样啊……\n不过，总觉得像魔术表演一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "4ffdb99455c86e751948b433c2a4faf02f00a7b93de776e747041eaa24d01c30", "ja": "よろしければ、\n人間用の箱や刀剣の類も用意できます。", "zh": "如果您需要的话，\n大变活人用的箱子和刀剑之类的我也能准备。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1013_401pro", "source_sha256": "76f8228ac3c23699894c782faa126eb0d744383760ceb51989abb9aec1fb40d1", "ja": "し、しなくていい！　運ぶのも大変だし……。\nとにかく、アイディアとして受け取っておくよ。", "zh": "不、不用准备了！搬起来也很麻烦……总之，我先把它当作一个点子收下了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "bd5395c78cb443d9b135188ac498d294a1eccf1e46363a1345fdfd82a22b845d", "ja": "よろしくお願いします。爽やかドリンクのラベルに\n仏頂面の私がいるだけでは、間が持てないかと……。", "zh": "请多关照。要是清爽饮料的标签上只有一脸严肃的我，恐怕会撑不起场面……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1015_401pro", "source_sha256": "5355808a1d0a2de70cc28148f50f9f951d7c76b8d0af277250b6a487fbeda7d5", "ja": "？　仏頂面？", "zh": "？一脸严肃？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "2fad8d85557997be85c482b1d8c61665aeffdd69415df676bd8fc03bf7a457d4", "ja": "はい。人からもよく言われます。\n私は表情があまり変わらないので。", "zh": "是的。别人也经常这么说。\n因为我的表情不太会变化。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1017_401pro", "source_sha256": "b93256cd685335a385c366bd55e8d169b29b3cdbce91c18057e49d2a8e8eb47a", "ja": "……確かに瑞希の表情は、そんなに大きくは変わらない\nみたいだけど……。でも、変わってるじゃないか。", "zh": "……确实，瑞希的面部表情看起来好像并没有太大\n变化……但是，明明是有变化的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1018_401pro", "source_sha256": "ecec0b1ebc7c50463eba9a5485b9e7c00bf6fcaf5317d055f1774e6046481f16", "ja": "瑞希は瑞希らしく、いろんな表情を見せてくれてる。\nさり気なくていいと思うんだけどな。", "zh": "瑞希以瑞希自己的方式，向我们展现着各种各样的表情。\n我觉得这种不经意的感觉就很好啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "ac8d06c9ca77da15e49493a38ddef61bd641473564461378804bb1ef2bf622eb", "ja": "なんと……意外な評価です。\n私の表情が、いつの間にそんなことを……。", "zh": "什么……真是出人意料的评价。\n我的表情，不知不觉间竟然变成那样了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1020_401pro", "source_sha256": "10888cc273adafbe75393d250a0a070a328e51c637d1938916479b947fcac83e", "ja": "いつもだよ。劇場にいる時、全員で話し合った時、\nデビューバトルイベントの時……。", "zh": "一直都是啊。你在剧场的时候、大家一起商量的时候、出道对战活动的时候……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1021_401pro", "source_sha256": "4ca72bdb23662b3633e3026da5612eaa4526bb15f8a204d55b0a18ea7c711611", "ja": "それから、今もかな？", "zh": "而且，现在也是吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "6e72ad0792c17e13bc4494c1785d64d3e66f43dc418ec1aba9aa76add6d89d25", "ja": "……。言われてみれば、今、\nほのかにドキドキしています。", "zh": "……经你这么一说，我现在\n确实隐隐有些心跳加速。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1023_044miz", "source_sha256": "46f7009cb25c2081ef1760d40b175f8ed56842af142640fddd79da052c9e5fe1", "ja": "自分でもかすかな、この気持ち……。\n伝えられていたんですね。", "zh": "连我自己都没察觉到的这份微妙心情……原来已经传达出去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1024_044miz", "source_sha256": "c2a46246a09a851411311de3307c71591728c2ab3ad38778b856ec6355270e4e", "ja": "……わかりました。前言撤回。\n小道具は持ち込まないことにします。", "zh": "……我明白了。收回前言。\n我决定不把道具带上去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1025_401pro", "source_sha256": "0f2b715608047d8effa0ccb988f117e9178f86a200e57ab866dd68c0c851613a", "ja": "……それがいいと思う。大丈夫、瑞希の笑顔は、\nちゃんとみんなの心に届くから。自信もっていこう！", "zh": "……我觉得那样比较好。没关系，瑞希的笑容一定能传达到大家心里。自信满满地上吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1026_044miz", "source_sha256": "b5098574329ef41cb6bada24b74123f6eea1e1f321a8079b40c5b5f585a5bd45", "ja": "はい。ただ……私の笑顔とは、\n言い切れないかもしれません。", "zh": "是。不过……也许还不能断言，那是我的笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1027_401pro", "source_sha256": "1e9e86cbe899c64e16885e9000e8611b8b04d4000b59c55eaba36c79322e7866", "ja": "？　というと？", "zh": "？你的意思是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1028_044miz", "source_sha256": "ac2c4b942fbfa68632349d7568f73cc0976fb0d1dfcede1ce2e66aec72c97846", "ja": "プロデューサー、Team2ndのみなさん。\nそして劇場の仲間達……。", "zh": "制作人、Team2nd的各位。  \n还有剧场的伙伴们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_02_1029_044miz", "source_sha256": "4b597732ac5689d0e0313cbc1f76a97a2a09d701281a35596a9582008c147121", "ja": "私が笑顔になれるとしたら、それは、\n私を笑顔にしてくれる人のおかげです。……にこっ。", "zh": "如果说我能够展露笑颜，那是因为，\n有让我绽放笑颜的人的缘故。……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
